   "text": "un singur runSyncCycle() la un moment dat (mutex)\ntrigger: nota noua  ·  app in foreground  ·  retea revenita\n            ·  pull-to-refresh  ·  timer de backoff\nbackoff 1s · 5s · 30s · 2min · 15min, max 5 -> status error\nbatch: max 50 note, din care max 4 trimise la categorizat",
   "originalText": "un singur runSyncCycle() la un moment dat (mutex)\ntrigger: nota noua  ·  app in foreground  ·  retea revenita\n            ·  pull-to-refresh  ·  timer de backoff\nbackoff 1s · 5s · 30s · 2min · 15min, max 5 -> status error\nbatch: max 50 note, din care max 4 trimise la categorizat",
