   "text": "users  ·  categories  ·  notes\nINSERT ... ON CONFLICT (uuid) DO UPDATE\n     WHERE EXCLUDED.updated_at > notes.updated_at\nlast-write-wins, deci retry-urile nu dubleaza nimic",
