   "seed": 414967080,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1639426226,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1786000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Bifat  ->  10 secunde  ->  trash  ->  30 de zile  ->  sters definitiv",
   "originalText": "Bifat  ->  10 secunde  ->  trash  ->  30 de zile  ->  sters definitiv",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "v3-text-0078",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0.0,
   "y": 2270.0,
   "width": 904.8000000000001,
   "height": 56.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0079",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1819357361,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 803947865,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1786000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Bifarea e singurul undo: debifezi in fereastra de 10s si nu mai pleaca nicaieri. O numaratoare in memorie,\nnu in baza — de aceea la pornire orice nota inca bifata e maturata direct in trash, fiind oricum expirata.\nTrash-ul e soft delete (deleted_at); ambele parti expira randurile independent, deci stergerile nu circula pe /sync.",
   "originalText": "Bifarea e singurul undo: debifezi in fereastra de 10s si nu mai pleaca nicaieri. O numaratoare in memorie,\nnu in baza — de aceea la pornire orice nota inca bifata e maturata direct in trash, fiind oricum expirata.\nTrash-ul e soft delete (deleted_at); ambele parti expira randurile independent, deci stergerile nu circula pe /sync.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "v3-text-0079",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0.0,
   "y": 2430.0,
   "width": 1235.52,
   "height": 45.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0080",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1737674321,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 618297282,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1786000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4.  Schema din Postgres  (db/migrations/, rulate de db/migrate.sh)",
   "originalText": "4.  Schema din Postgres  (db/migrations/, rulate de db/migrate.sh)",
   "fontSize": 36,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "v3-text-0080",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0.0,
   "y": 2480.0,
   "width": 657.28,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#5c5f66",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0081",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1650359626,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 121256461,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1786000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Inlocuieste schema \"minimal\" din v1, care era ce se planificase, nu ce ruleaza.",
   "originalText": "Inlocuieste schema \"minimal\" din v1, care era ce se planificase, nu ce ruleaza.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
